---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base title="Zagros — Security Intelligence RAG" description="Local-first CVE + CWE, ASVS, CAPEC, ATT&CK search for humans and AI agents. Rust CLI, MCP server, HelixDB.">
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span>v0.1.0 · rust · helixdb · mcp · bm25</div>
        <h1>Local-first CVE search for humans and agents.</h1>
        <p class="lede">500+ CVEs plus CWE, ASVS, CAPEC and ATT&amp;CK in one HelixDB index. Terminal, web UI, or MCP — every claim cites its source.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-art">
        <img src={`${base}zagros.png`} alt="Zagros — octopus over mountains, MCP shield" width="340" height="340" />
      </figure>
      <div class="cta-row hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`${base}docs/`}>Get started</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={`${base}demo/`}>Try a search</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal">
      <div class="term-bar"><span>$ zagros search "remote code execution" --top-k 5</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="copy-lite" data-copy='zagros search "remote code execution" --top-k 5'>copy</button></div>
      <div class="term-body">
        <div><span class="o">1 · CVE-2026-17061</span> <span class="g">18.4</span></div>
        <div><span class="c">Heap buffer overflow in packet parser → remote code execution.</span></div>
        <div><span class="d">src</span> <a href="https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-17061">cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-17061</a></div>
        <div><span class="o">2 · CWE-787</span> <span class="g">9.1</span></div>
        <div><span class="c">Out-of-bounds Write — writes past the end of the intended buffer.</span></div>
        <div><span class="d">src</span> <a href="https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/787.html">cwe.mitre.org/definitions/787</a></div>
        <div><span class="o">3 · T1190</span> <span class="g">6.7</span></div>
        <div><span class="c">Exploit Public-Facing Application — initial access via RCE.</span></div>
        <div><span class="d">src</span> <a href="https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/">attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">Corpora</div>
    <h2>One index. Five authorities.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Seed snapshot 2026-09-08 · ~3,100 nodes. Verify anytime with <span class="mono">zagros status</span>.</p>
    <div class="card feature"><div class="num">499+</div><div><span class="tag">cvelistV5 deltaLog · hourly</span><h3>CVE records</h3><p>Exact-ID lookup plus BM25 ranked search with source URLs on every hit.</p></div></div>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">MITRE CWE 4.15</span><div class="num">969</div><h3>Weaknesses</h3><p>Know <span class="mono">CWE-787</span>? Zagros does.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">OWASP ASVS 5.0</span><div class="num">345</div><h3>Requirements</h3><p>Map findings to verifiable controls.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">MITRE CAPEC 3.9</span><div class="num">613</div><h3>Attack patterns</h3><p>How attackers actually get in.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">ATT&amp;CK v16.1</span><div class="num">697</div><h3>Techniques</h3><p>Enterprise tactics, queryable offline.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">Install</div>
    <h2>Up in three steps.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Prereqs: Rust 1.85+, Docker + Compose v2. No OpenSSL — reqwest uses rustls.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="n">1</div><div><h3>Start the stack <button class="copy-lite" data-copy="docker compose -f docker/compose.yml up -d">copy</button></h3><p>HelixDB on <span class="mono">127.0.0.1:47474</span>, MCP on <span class="mono">:8789</span>, UI on <span class="mono">:8788</span>.</p><pre class="code">docker compose -f docker/compose.yml up -d</pre></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">2</div><div><h3>Seed the index <button class="copy-lite" data-copy="zagros backfill --limit 500 && zagros source all">copy</button></h3><p>Idempotent — safe to re-run.</p><pre class="code"><span class="cm"># ~499 CVEs + 2,624 knowledge docs</span>
.\target\debug\zagros.exe backfill --limit 500
.\target\debug\zagros.exe source all</pre></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><div><h3>Connect your agent</h3><p>Streamable HTTP for opencode / OpenCode.</p><pre class="code">&#123;
  <span class="hl">"mcpServers"</span>: &#123;
    <span class="hl">"zagros"</span>: &#123;
      <span class="hl">"type"</span>: <span class="hl">"streamable-http"</span>,
      <span class="hl">"url"</span>: "http://localhost:8789/mcp"
    &#125;
  &#125;
&#125;</pre></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">MCP</div>
    <h2>Four tools. Zero guesswork.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Same four tools over stdio (<span class="mono">zagros-mcp</span>) and Streamable HTTP (<span class="mono">zagros-mcp-http</span>).</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">search_cves</span><h3>Ranked CVE search</h3><p>BM25 + field weights, exact-match &amp; phrase bonuses.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">get_cve</span><h3>Exact CVE lookup</h3><p><span class="mono">CVE-2026-17061</span> → full record + source URL.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">index_status</span><h3>Index health</h3><p>Counts + newest timestamp before you sync.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag">sync_cves</span><h3>Delta sync</h3><p>Pull latest, upsert. Approval-required, 5-min cooldown.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:flex-start">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost mono" href={`${base}demo/`}>Try a search →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost mono" href={`${base}docs/mcp/`}>MCP reference →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Base>
